## Project Overview

Built to provide an ultra-responsive, zero-friction developer portfolio. Combines the speed of static site generation with a localized visual CMS for effortless markdown authoring.

### Key Highlights

- **Sub-50ms TTFB**: Delivered via edge-optimized static output.
- **Neo-Brutalist Architecture**: High-voltage yellow and dark aesthetic with crisp tactile block shadows.
- **Content Flexibility**: Dual-mode Keystatic configuration allowing seamless local authoring and remote GitHub synchronization.
